# oracle: fix ilves on a four-atom chain of masses 12 16 12 16 (bonds 1-2, 2-3, 3-4 stretched): velocities projected at run 0, tol 1e-4 iter 25, a lennard-jones pair term between the bonded atoms (special lj 1 1 1); thermo and every per-atom position, velocity and force after 50 steps
# oracle-inputs: w50il_chain.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-7 abs=1e-9
units           real
atom_style      bond
read_data       w50il_chain.data
pair_style      lj/cut 3.0
pair_coeff      * * 0.05 0.8
bond_style      harmonic
bond_coeff      1 100.0 1.0
special_bonds   lj 1.0 1.0 1.0
neighbor        0.3 bin
timestep        1.0
fix             1 all nve
fix             cons all ilves 1.0e-4 25 0 b 1
thermo_style    custom step pe ebond press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             50
